# Normalize text line endings in the repository, check out native on Windows.
* text=auto

# Text formats, diffable
*.md   text
*.tex  text
*.py   text
*.html text

# Binary formats, never diff or merge these as text
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
# *.jpg added Monday 26 October 2026 with the first photographs this repository
# has carried. png was already here and jpg was not, which would have left git
# free to treat a photograph as text: that means line-ending normalisation on
# checkout, which corrupts the file.
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
